From: meanaverage <18336095+meanaverage@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:48:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/16] fix(web): sync the clipboard automatically for the
 focused session only

With several sessions on a page, each one polled the local clipboard and sent
it to its server, and wrote whatever its server copied to the local clipboard
as soon as the window had the focus. A copy on one remote desktop could then
be overwritten by another that was merely open in the background.

Automatic clipboard sync now belongs to the session whose component has the
keyboard focus: the others neither read the local clipboard nor write it.
A remote copy on a session without the focus waits until that session gets it
(`focusin`), keeping only the latest content.
